{
  "description": "Enhanced item sorting: modified_at and interacted_at sorts across kinds, DESC by size, interacted_at fallback to modified_at, no-kind treated as file, the already-sorted no-op short-circuit path, empty entries list, single entry, and the three error categories (unsupported field, unknown item type, malformed collection).",
